  ], partialImpacts: {anesuGuard: -0.3}, nudgeImpacts: {anesuGuard: -1, familyAwareness: 0.5}, skipImpacts: {anesuGuard: 1}},
  {type: "interject", text: "Oh please, this tool? This fucking guy? You met him on some lame app, we seriously can't still be doing this."},
  {type: "interject", text: "Maybe this isn't the time for it. This is the opposite of putting yourself first."},
  {type: "interject", text: "And all of a sudden being okay with having sex is a huge deal out of nowhere. Why the big jump with him? Why not wai—"},
  {type: "choice", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", text: "I'm gonna see him tonight", dest: "V2_02_GoingToSeeElias", impacts: {anesuGuard: 1}},
